Scope note
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this archive (atpp/,
experiments/, tests/).

The figures in figures/ and the result files (results_*.json) are released
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

No third-party data is redistributed in this archive. The semi-synthetic
experiments require the published cuttings XRF dataset of Hall, B. (2018),
CSEG Recorder, which must be obtained from its original source under whatever
terms that source sets. See the README.
